295	          <span class="soon">In arrivo</span>
296	        </div>
297	        <div class="channel light">
298	          <svg width="44" height="44" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 4h4l2 5-2.5 1.5a11 11 0 0 0 5 5L15 13l5 2v4a2 2 0 0 1-2 2A16 16 0 0 1 3 6a2 2 0 0 1 2-2z"/></svg>
299	          <h3>Al telefono</h3>
300	          <p>Chiama Vela e racconta il viaggio che hai in mente.</p>
301	          <span class="soon">In arrivo</span>
302	        </div>
303	      </div>
304	    </div>
305	  </section>
